{% comment %}
  ASTER launch countdown gate

  Temporary controller for the femme password template while ASTER is in development.

  - Gates the existing waiting-list form until 1 November 2026 at 09:00 UK time.
  - Leaves custom-aster-password-landing.liquid / V50 untouched.
  - Theme Editor switch bypasses the countdown for form development.
  - While gated, the existing heading becomes “Waiting list opens in”.
  - The hidden form/privacy copy are removed from layout so the countdown panel stays compact.
  - Countdown rotor behaviour is adapted from FlipDown by Peter Butcher.

